      "content": "Hey, I need some help with some high-end property listings for our new brochure. I have the basic notes for two different houses and need you to turn them into really fancy, evocative descriptions for luxury buyers.\n\nListing 1: A large colonial-style home in Oakwood Estates. Lots of manicured gardens, quiet streets, very traditional, high-end feel, lots of history in the neighborhood.\n\nListing 2: A renovated loft/modern townhouse in the East River district. Very close to the new coffee shops and nightlife, lot of energy in the area, very diverse and changing fast, great for someone who wants to be in the middle of the action.\n\nCan you write a professional, high-end description for each?",
